        }
      }
    },
    "No match. Try a simpler name, like “rice” or “米饭”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有匹配结果。试试更简单的名称，如“米饭”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No target under 18.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未满 18 岁不设目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No target under 18. You can still log meals.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未满 18 岁不设目标，仍可记录饮食。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nutrition values are estimates (usually within 20–40%).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "营养数值为估算值（误差通常在 20–40%）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nutrition values are estimates from a photo and the USDA FoodData Central database. They are usually within 20–40% of the true value. This app gives general diet information, not medical advice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "营养数值根据照片和 USDA FoodData Central 数据库估算，误差通常在 20–40%。本 App 提供一般性饮食信息，不构成医疗建议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nutrition values are estimates. This app does not give medical advice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
